---
/* The public sales page: the site's front page `/` in a TRIAL build only
   (injected by trialSalesHome() in astro.config.mjs). The open build has no
   page here; its `/` redirects to the dashboard as before.

   It keeps its own approved look (gates, campus, green and orange, Manrope
   headings) through StoryLayout, separate from the workspace design. */
import StoryLayout from '../layouts/StoryLayout.astro';
import NextChapter from '../components/home/NextChapter.astro';
---
<StoryLayout><NextChapter /></StoryLayout>
